{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_03_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11b4b9560f8164cf8d157d8ca267133ba8fbdb93f1b10125650284748d96d9a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce090f535487a1c1a125fea0310e7508c580cd0c9aa0a01115342d802fda70b",
      "text": "恭喜各位合格！\n接下来，我们来谈谈今后的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab30744a56c4921f315afd007c58899c10b842f9742b78197fd87c64c54bd28",
      "text": "今后为了出道，各位需要\n以三人一组的形式参加各种训练课程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1aa0355b96f38ff47ca295c7ede0aed1faab8cb5d247a1f9df48b68af857bfb",
      "text": "……等等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1ce7aea768c8cd9fce4795edb1780306a8b78a2f68d96fda169b87d63d384f3",
      "text": "？好的，请问有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6efccfb257b931e294d0af1f35783293b0a1f7bae420701533736fcd257a349",
      "text": "难道说，是要我和这两个人组队\n出道吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e404d44f87a3569d1aae52a5bbf562813fd3038cb839dff9f35f93b854b99c2",
      "text": "不，倒也不是这么绝对……\n但也有这种可能性！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:359a55ff8eff20068975c76a2e19e6156b1c43551b3bd4933450cdf6dfff52cc",
      "text": "是吗。\n既然这样，刚才的合格我就放弃了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eac3bdf6a1fe0ba76ebf56e824137916380a28e7455c97d9b7694ad3e815739",
      "text": "哎哎！为、为什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c7c55ca0df989665e822b7a3230867bdb320303ef00e47847b8ee2f71f1a319",
      "text": "我没有必要和任何人组队。\n一个人就足够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bc1985d961b1c6224031a5ab642b97d4e303cd47ff29f8e72cbd57a9c1f596",
      "text": "为了证明这一点，\n我会再去参加一次试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f18ff87f3fe277500031c1f18c37e9404decec2bfe6e88ffc5373f9100fa48b",
      "text": "并且，要让他们承诺让我一个人出道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b851c2edb85bd440ff3eeae5a758b3fcdecdde22319a882788bd2c54e0a50ba",
      "text": "不过要参加的，大概不是这间事务所的试镜\n就是了。……其他参加者的水平太低了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
